  "label": "Tickets",
  "tagline": "Players ask for help, staff claim it: tickets, your own staff roles, staff chat, warn, kick, ban and Discord",
  "category": "Admin",
  "description": "A ticket window for players (a key or /ticket) and a large staff panel. Tickets are tracked live, routed to the right staff by kind, claimed by one person, answered in a conversation or in person with a one-press teleport, and posted to Discord as one message that is edited as the ticket moves. Staff roles are yours to make: name them, and tick what each may do, which tickets it sees and whose staff chat it reads. Staff chat is never saved. A ticket can be escalated to another role, carry internal notes, have its answer marked and, if staff choose, be shared with every player with the names hidden. Bans use poggy_core's account bans.",
